WEBVTT

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.700
You'll definitely remember, Kaito!

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:03.180
Seira!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:12.170
Seira, I'll definitely get your orange heart shards back!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.150
Breakup of the Sisters

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.950
What in the world is this clam?

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.150
It's not letting go!

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.140
We did it!

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:24.830
This is a huge success!

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.870
It's Show Time!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.540
We didn't have to use the ball of light that Mikeru gave us.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.190
How true!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.700
This is the end!

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.490
Mimi!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.600
You're going to get it, Mermaid Princesses!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:28.620
All right!

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.900
D-Darn it!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.860
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.120
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.450
Green Pearl Voice!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.110
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.590
We were doing so well up until now!

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.970
This feels horrible!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:31.510
Just a bit more and we would have captured the Mermaid Princesses.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:35.420
Sister Mimi! It's all because you went overboard that this happened!

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:36.360
But...

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:39.980
At the rate we're going, we're going to get another earful from Mikeru-sama!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:43.810
It {seems that}looks like you failed again, Sheshe and Mimi.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:45.040
You shut up!

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.670
We'll definitely capture them next time!

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.110
{Pupupu}Hehe! And how many "next times" do you need?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:56.470
If you don't show results soon, you're going to get sent back to the darkest depths of the ocean!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:05.050
This is bad. I don't want to get exiled to the depths of the oceans again, Sister Sheshe!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:09.950
Before you mess up again,{make another blunder,} I still think we should use the ball of light that Mikeru-sama gave us.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.350
You trying to say something!?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.980
It seems like that you're piling all the blame on me!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.510
Oh my, isn't that the case?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:20.080
If you want to blame it all on me, then hurry up and use the ball of light!

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.270
What's your problem!?

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.880
Are those words you use with your older sister?

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.190
An older sister is supposed to support her younger sister!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:31.560
An younger sister is supposed to obey her older sister!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.180
{Goodness gracious!}For crying out loud! I'd be glad if I didn't have a younger sister like you!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:42.280
{Goodness,}Awww, now as for{I need to think about} the next battle plan...

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.810
I understand.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:49.630
Even without your plan, I'll show you that I can capture the Mermaid Princesses alone!

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.590
Hmph! I'd like to see you try.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.020
Sheshe, you idiot!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.420
Mimi!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.340
Mimi...

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.740
Sheshe, you're an idiot.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.530
You didn't have to tear into me like that.

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:10.510
The Mermaid Princesses must be living in this city.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:11.630
Let's do this!

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:16.480
I'm going to show Sister Sheshe that I can get it done alone.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:26.070
The Mermaid Princesses will be lured out when I sing.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:50.850
Where in the world are the Mermaid Princesses?

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.670
This is weird.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:56.550
They should've appeared when they heard my singing.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.970
This way of doing battle isn't going to work...

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.760
Right, Sister Sheshe?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.270
Sheshe isn't here.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:11.170
Awww. I've been on my feet all day, and now I'm really hungry.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.240
I guess I should drink some water.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:19.340
Huh? The water isn't coming out. Why?

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:26.660
Ugh!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.830
Are you okay?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.500
{If you don't mind,}If you want, you can go ahead and use this.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.210
What's so damn funny!?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.460
What are you talking about?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.040
I'm lending it to you out of kindness!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.230
You're too nosy!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.220
You were laughing behind my back!

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.490
You didn't have to pull my cheeks!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.380
What {the hell }in the world are you doing, then?

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.060
You're laughing at someone else's failure!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:52.770
You're just like my damn older sister!

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:57.440
Your older sister is sure putting up with a lot, with such a cheeky little sister like you!

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.250
What did you say!?

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.270
{What did you say?}What about it!?

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.180
Are you hungry by any chance?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.740
Would you like to come to my place?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:11.370
Huh?

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.850
She must be really hungry.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.780
She apparently had a fight with her older sister.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:25.360
And I guess she hasn't eaten anything.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.400
A fight with her older sister?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.600
We're back!

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.080
Hanon. Rina.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:31.740
Oh? We have a guest?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.880
Yeah, I met her in the park on the way home.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.660
By the way, what's your name?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.110
Eh? My name?

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:42.150
My name is...

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.170
Marigold...

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:47.330
Oh no! My name is Mari.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:55.290
Mari-chan, even though you had a fight with your older sister, she's probably really worried about you.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.690
{However, }I'm not going home.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:58.970
Why?

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:04.100
I also... I also want to show my older sister that I can do things by myself.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:07.260
I won't go home until I succeed.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.450
You're not going home? Do you at least have a place to stay?

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:12.850
I figure I'll just find a place outside to sleep.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.330
Onee-chan?

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:15.180
What is it?

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:18.470
Can I have Mari stay in my room, just for tonight?

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.330
I don't mind.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.300
So, Mari...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:21.730
Hmm?

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:23.750
Why don't we sleep in the same bed?

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.690
So, Mari, how are my cute pajamas?

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.490
I don't really like pink.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.410
Oh well.

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:37.630
I'm glad!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.010
Lucia! Mari!

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.710
Nikora-san made us pancakes {for us }to eat.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.930
As for a drink, how does black tea sound?

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.490
Ah, thanks!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.740
Let's eat, Mari.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:49.930
O-Okay.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.340
Aren't my big sister's pancakes yummy, Mari?

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.510
Y-Yeah.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.350
Nikora's cooking is always delicious.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.390
Mari, are you a middle school student?

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.810
Y-Yeah... I guess so.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.920
Hey, Mari. Do you have a boyfriend?

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:10.890
How could I have one?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.820
Eh? How can you not have when you're so cute!?

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.860
I'm... cute?

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:20.130
What do you think, Miss-Rina-who-secretly-meets-with-her-boyfriend?

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.860
I'm not being secretive!

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:25.710
I was just at the gym watching him practice!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.960
So, what about you, Hanon?

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:33.780
That's right! Weren't you with Nagisa-kun after school again?

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:37.910
W-Well, that's because tests are coming up and he's a dummy.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:40.130
I was just tutoring him a bit.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.770
Was that all?

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.890
You're not one to talk, Rina.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:48.250
By the way, Mari. Why did you get into a fight with your older sister?

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.730
Eh? Well, that's...

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.380
We've got some mutual rivals.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:57.230
Today, because of my clumsiness, they defeated us.

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:02.390
I got scolded by her, and because of that, we got into a fight.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.120
So I ran off.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:07.540
But Mari, you really get along with your older sister, don't you?

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:08.790
That's...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.980
But I don't know what I should do.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.100
It's all a matter of your attitude.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.130
You want your sister to respect your abilities, right?

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.990
If that's so, then show her the best you can do.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:23.850
The best I can do?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.280
That's right.

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:28.970
So for example, you can fight the rivals on your own...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.580
...and show your older sister that you wouldn't give up no matter how many times you lost, right?

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.540
Not give up no matter how many times I lost...

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:43.940
Yeah! Once your older sister sees how hard you try, she'll understand how you feel.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:53.020
Thank you! I'll do my best!

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.050
Do your best, Mari.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:05.140
If something happens, come on back.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:07.870
We'll become your strength then.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.640
Thank you, everyone!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.030
I feel full of energy!

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:15.510
Next time, bring your older sister here, Mari.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.800
Okay! I will!

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.340
My goodness, Mimi.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.380
She didn't come back at all last night.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.190
Where in the world did she go?

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:31.480
Oh? Mimi isn't here.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:32.760
What's wrong?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:33.910
I don't know.

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.560
She just ran off!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.480
Eh? I see.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.850
The two of you can't capture the Mermaid Princesses.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:43.040
Can you do it alone?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.570
She won't be dragging me down.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:49.270
I see. The two of you really aren't getting along.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.600
Shut up!

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.720
I can't concentrate on making a battle plan!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.830
Not again!

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.770
Everyone is encouraging me.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.140
I'll show you can I can do it myself, Sister Sheshe.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:10.860
Even if I have to use all my strength!

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.990
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.990
I'm going to use this waterspout and lure the Mermaid Princesses here!

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:35.820
Stop right there! I'm not going to let you have your way!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:39.950
I knew it was caused by you two, Black Beauty Sisters!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:43.830
You've stepped into my trap of your own volition, Mermaid Princesses!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.540
No matter what{don't care what I do}, I'm not going to lose!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.350
Eh? They're missing a person today.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.380
I can defeat you by myself!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.320
The two of you aren't worth a penny.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.270
Quiet, you!

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:59.450
Be careful, Lucia. The other one may be hiding somewhere.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.970
Before Sheshe shows up, let's go! Hanon! Rina!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.330
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.810
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.620
Green Pearl Voice!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.560
I'm not going to let you sing!

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.140
I was wondering where Mimi went,

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.100
but it looks like she's trying to capture the Mermaid Princesses by herself.

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:40.230
She's going to exhaust her strength just sustaining that waterspout.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.630
It won't be effective{This is ineffective} against the Mermaid Princesses.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.930
You think so?

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.280
I think Mimi is doing really well.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.980
Here I go! You're going to {hell}get it, Mermaid Princesses!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.920
It's Show Time!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.480
It seems to be ineffective.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.420
Is it because Sheshe isn't here?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.670
Lucia! Hanon!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.300
All right, let's go!

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:18.310
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:36.180
Oh no! The waterspout disappeared!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.740
Can I not do it alone?

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.680
Am I not able to do it without Sheshe?

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:47.660
I told you, she has no strength left to sing.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.550
Are you going to help her?

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:52.840
I'm going to leave her alone. She'll come back eventually.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.720
She can't do anything without me.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:58.070
Ahh! It hurts!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.680
I knew I couldn't do it without her!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.230
Save me, Sheshe!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.650
You really get along with your older sister, don't you?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.550
You want your sister to respect your abilities, right?

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.470
She'll understand how you feel.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.390
What?

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.050
You want to fight us again?

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.970
She seems really stubborn today.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.730
I'm definitely not going to lose!

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.120
I'm going to defeat you even if I have to do it alone!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.600
She did it!

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:38.420
Eh?

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:42.530
She might actually defeat the Mermaid Princesses!

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.930
Don't do it, Mimi!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:49.880
If you use your powers like that, your body won't be able to take it!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.120
You're something, aren't you?

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.670
She's just about exhausted her strength.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.490
Rina! Hanon!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.020
Let's give her another song!

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:38.620
It hurts, but I still have to defeat them by myself!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.440
I have to hang in there! Sheshe is watching me!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:58.530
Sheshe! I'm not going to lose!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.450
Love Shower Pitch!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.940
Sister Mimi, hang in there!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.260
Sister... Sheshe...

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:42.450
Why are you here?

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.900
I know that you tried to fight them alone.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:46.360
I already know it.

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:52.610
I knew... that you were watching me... Sister Sheshe...

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:57.920
Of course. That's because you're my {most... most important}very, very precious little sister!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.490
I'm happy... Sheshe...

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.490
Mimi...

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:09.840
Mermaid Princesses! How dare you hurt my darling Mimi like this!

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.310
Now it's my turn to attack!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:19.300
What in the world? The waterspouts are starting up again!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.780
Sheshe is here!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.030
You've got to be kidding me.

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.100
They're also stronger than the waterspouts from before!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.380
The two of them are getting along really well.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.620
It looks like they're using the ball to great effect.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:39.390
At the rate this is going, we can probably take away the Mermaid Princesses' powers!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.630
Sister Mimi! What's wrong?

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.440
Hang on, Mimi!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.920
Mimi!

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:57.070
I can finally give good news to Mikeru-sama!

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:00.900
Eh? Huh? Where are the Black Beauty Sisters?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.620
Eh? Why? Why?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.560
Where did they go?

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.840
That was a huge opportunity!

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.520
The waterspouts disappeared.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.350
The Black Beauty Sisters don't seem to be around, either.

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:16.420
I wonder if something happened?

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:33.060
Are you awake, Sister Mimi?

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.100
T-This is...

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:36.710
We're at the bottom of the ocean.

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:40.870
I figure that this would be the best place to get you healed.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.930
Thank you, Sister Sheshe...

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:49.650
Sheshe, you're using the ball of light to heal me!?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:54.800
This is bad! That's the power we need to defeat the Mermaid Princesses!

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:59.120
If you use that power on me, we're going to be severely punished by Mikeru-sama!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:00.670
It's all right.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:07.790
As long as I'm with you, I don't care if we get thrown back into the dark depths of the ocean.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.830
Sheshe...

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:51.970
A bus guide.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:55.800
Uhh... the rent for the toilet and washing facilities here costs 60,000...

00:23:56.100 --> 00:23:58.070
That's a bus guide!?

00:23:58.170 --> 00:23:59.500
A field trip.

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.920
Uhh... the rent for the toilet and washing facilities here...

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:03.150
That's enough!

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:04.530
If you'll excuse us...

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:07.280
This bus guide isn't who she appears to be.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:11.150
It's like she's worked with me forever.

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:12.140
She's amazing.

00:24:12.560 --> 00:24:15.350
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:16.780
Seira's Garden.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:20.170
Why don't the Mermaid Princesses show up?
